      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『——母亲大人，父亲大人。二位，早安。今日，\n也是个好日子……呵呵，别那么惊讶嘛。那么，今天也请多指教』",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6f1e0b14016daa0c331891aa56522ccbea92c0f726f5838c0b3028de95e6181",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
