    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2eeff7f9d779f5267a8cdcf2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（不断地、不断地克制感性的自己……好不容易，才走到了这一步。\n就差一步……应该就差一步了啊……！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "21942ebd87f4bf5ce541a721bae3817f926263d62e3ff79fc72b8f449b57e2a1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
