    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c9dd4a9a556373cec1537de",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了探寻要得到黄金巨匠的认可，究竟还需要些什么——\n从今天起，我开始在一旁观看旺紫丁的训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e70f427407ce619e90ebec8c215f221114254e9bc1125184c44bb3792a38ac0d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
