    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe0c97f2c533f7d8a308a98f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那不就是我的全名嘛！别把它当成组合名啊！\n再说，训练员你打算拿哪边当名字！？我可不给哦！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "48402ad1d4dcd2449754dc8f99677fbf253773d41842884b0fb9ca0c7027710f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
