      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我明白了。首先是肌肉力量训练对吧。\n这菜单看起来负荷相当大呢……但我会努力试试看的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e840a8932733787a40cb706538b0691c62d89a0947ba9fd6c9bde459ad840cde",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
