      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——呼……能顺利完成真是太好了。不过，是啊……\n负荷再稍微大一点的菜单，我也不介意哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0a64c811ad9cdaee035f62dc79fb652b88f77e84e9b138308f592097d709c1d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
